Z||000004||theogre||08-15-2000||03:15 PM||||take it and have it tested. Yes a short can fry an alternator but likely it was going anyway. You may have to replace the battery to if it's been pulled all the way down. car batteries don't take well to being pulled below about 9-10V more than once or twice if that much.||||reg||1
